      "id": 478851,
      "username": "TalhaButt2508",
      "name": "Talha Butt2508",
      "created_at": "2025-08-25T12:40:03.829Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi everyone,<br>\nWe’ve set up budgets in ERPNext with monthly distribution linked to cost centers. The annual budget check works fine, but the system does not stop or warn when a particular month’s distributed budget is exceeded. The action is already set to <em>Stop on Monthly Distribution Exceeded</em>, but still, entries are posting without validation. Has anyone faced this issue or found a fix?</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/talhabutt2508/{size}/89640_2.png",
      "trust_level": 2,
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
